    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[[Google Privacy Sandbox] Chrome 156 stubs out Fenced Frame API]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31038</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31038"/>
        <updated>2026-11-03T12:07:37.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">This PR replaces <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5628048996" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30697" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30697/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30697">#30697</a>. I've recreated it to use a ranged statement to indicate that there was full support between 126-156. It is partial from 156 onwards and will likely be removed completely in the future.</p>
<p dir="auto">Original PR comment:</p>
<blockquote>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/c9w5uH3eSuo/m/oG9HX5UfCQAJ" rel="nofollow">This message from intent to remove sent on Sept 28:</a></p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">We landed the required code in M156. The fenced frame element and window.fence are now stubs starting in M156. We will start the experiment to remove the stubs in M157. Thanks!</p>
</blockquote>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/6366274495053824" rel="nofollow">Chrome Status entry (updated recently)</a></p>
<p dir="auto">This Chromium commit removed Fenced Frames API:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8144621" rel="nofollow">CL 8144621</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/chromium/chromium/commit/55fa5f273aed691fbe11a449cabf1943fb284f74">This commit on GitHub</a></li>
<li><a href="https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/fenced-frame/fenced-frame-stub.https.html">WPT test for stubs</a> - this explains all the <code class="notranslate">notes</code> I added.</li>
</ul>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">This is a direct follow-up to my earlier PR deprecating Fenced Frame API <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5161427314" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30242" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30242/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30242">#30242</a><br>
This is relaed to Shared Storeage API PR I created <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5568937249" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30659" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30659/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/30659">#30659</a></p>
</blockquote>]]></content>
