        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add web extension data for `icon_variants` in Safari and Chrome, and correct `menus.update.icons`.]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31029</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31029"/>
        <updated>2026-11-03T19:53:43.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190589?u=f533e20910aae6e8ef669d6ccf02c94d3ca93d5c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Adds web extension data for <code class="notranslate">icon_variants</code> and the related icon properties, and corrects <code class="notranslate">menus.update.icons</code> for Safari.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">icon_variants</code> as a manifest key and in <code class="notranslate">action</code>, <code class="notranslate">browser_action</code> and <code class="notranslate">page_action</code>: Safari 18.2. Chrome 127 for the manifest key and Chrome 136 for <code class="notranslate">action</code>, both behind <code class="notranslate">--enable-features=ExtensionIconVariants</code>.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">variants</code> in <code class="notranslate">action.setIcon()</code> and <code class="notranslate">browserAction.setIcon()</code>: Safari 18.2.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">iconVariants</code> in <code class="notranslate">menus.create()</code> and <code class="notranslate">menus.update()</code>: Safari 26.2, with the earlier <code class="notranslate">icon_variants</code> spelling as the alternative name from Safari 18.2.</li>
<li>The <code class="notranslate">any</code> size key for <code class="notranslate">icons</code> and <code class="notranslate">default_icon</code>: Safari 18.2.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">menus.update.icons</code>: Safari 18.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">The <code class="notranslate">mdn_url</code> for <code class="notranslate">icon_variants</code> is left out until the MDN page exists.</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">npm run lint -- webextensions</code> passes.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://webkit.org/b/278818" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/278818</a></li>
<li><a href="https://webkit.org/b/279135" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/b/279135</a></li>
<li><a href="https://webkit.org/blog/15978/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-204/" rel="nofollow">https://webkit.org/blog/15978/release-notes-for-safari-technology-preview-204/</a></li>
<li><a href="https://crbug.com/41419485" rel="nofollow">https://crbug.com/41419485</a></li>
<li><a href="https://crbug.com/344639840" rel="nofollow">https://crbug.com/344639840</a></li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5950262602" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/issues/1134" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/webextensions/pull/1134/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/webextensions/pull/1134">w3c/webextensions#1134</a></li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #31028.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6174119287" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31028" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31028/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/31028">#31028</a></p>]]></content>
