    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[WebTransport stream/send group getStats(): mark partial implementations]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31011</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/31011"/>
        <updated>2026-11-02T04:07:46.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF160 is supposed to add support for <code class="notranslate">getStats()</code> in <code class="notranslate">WebTransportSendStream</code>/<code class="notranslate">ReceiveStream</code>/<code class="notranslate">SendGroup</code>  in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2021710" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2021710</a> but Claude and tests show that it is not in, and is likely to be in 161.</p>
<p dir="auto">This updates things to match the current state for all browsers prior to whenever this goes in.</p>
<p dir="auto">Tests:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.worker.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.worker.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></li>
<li><a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.html?label=experimental&amp;label=master&amp;aligned</a></li>
<li><a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.html?label=master&amp;label=stable" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.html?label=master&amp;label=stable</a></li>
<li><a href="https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.worker.html?label=master&amp;label=stable" rel="nofollow">https://wpt.fyi/results/webtransport/stream-stats.https.any.worker.html?label=master&amp;label=stable</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">In fact <code class="notranslate">WebTransportSendStream.getStats()</code> and <code class="notranslate">WebTransportReceiveStream.getStats()</code> always reject with <code class="notranslate">NotSupportedError</code> and <code class="notranslate">WebTransportSendGroup.getStats()</code> always resolves with an empty object. This marks the original introductions as partial.</p>
<p dir="auto">Safari: WebTransportSendGroup.getStats() counts only datagram bytes sent through the group, not stream bytes. Marked as partial_implementation.</p>
<p dir="auto">Chrome: add impl_url links to the Chromium tracking issues. This is expected to release around 159 - see <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5235261159112704" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5235261159112704</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Related FF docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6044199582" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46277" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/46277/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46277">mdn/content#46277</a></p>]]></content>
